  triage:title "partial_artifact hard-failure branch only reachable from unit tests" ;
  triage:description "scripts/smoke/read_benchmark.py has a partial_artifact hard-failure branch that no production code path sets; it is exercised only by scripts/smoke/test_read_benchmark.py. D7 requires partial artifacts to be a real hard campaign failure, so the production path must detect and set it (or the dead branch must go). Source: quality-mgr phase-av-sprint-av4-qa-r1, PR #1114 (REQ-AV4-4)." ;
